# Descriptor of the downloadable set "Large windows" on Original HD (built by shared/assets/build_asset_set.py via tools/make_windows_sets.py, format: docs/asset_sets.md). NOT published to the server.
# One COMPLETE kit per interface skin: archive 8 (backpack 8/4, trade 8/5 + columns 8/88..91, tab looks, Sort-button sprites 663..665, character stats background 8/186) and dat/flat.cmp
# (inventpl.bmg with the centred pair [Close | Sort], tradepl.bmg, statuspl.bmg). The kit goes in and out AS A WHOLE (a flat.cmp without the sprites crashes the backpack): the program
# also checks "sprites in archive 8 >= highest index used by the bmg files". The rest of the kit is in gfx.txt: patch=windows (exe), cmpentry= (statuspl layout inside global.cmp), textrec= (tooltip).
# flat.cmp: the pristine one of the game; skin A (own flat.cmp) is NOT combinable with this set (the orig list names only the pristine flat.cmp).
